  "label": "Cat Piss Stereotype",
  "description": "A vulgar and offensive stereotype used to insult someone's hygiene, implying they have a foul odor or are unclean. This is a crude, degrading comparison that relies on the real-world association of cat urine with unpleasant smells, often used to demean individuals perceived as dirty or lacking in personal care. In the meme, 'cat piss you smell like' is used to directly insult the subject's hygiene, leveraging this offensive stereotype.",
